in, facilitated by VR technology, regardless of their physical location or background.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Accessibility\": \"Available to students from all backgrounds and locations\",\n        \"Technology Requirement\": \"VR headsets\",\n        \"Purpose\": \"To enhance learning through interactive and cooperative experiences\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Educators\",\n      \"type\": \"Group\",\n      \"description\": \"Educators are professionals responsible for teaching and facilitating learning in various educational settings, including schools, universities, and other learning environments. They play a crucial role in integrating new technologies, such as virtual reality, to enhance educational experiences and cater to diverse learning needs.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Role\": \"Teaching and Facilitating Learning\",\n        \"Responsibility\": \"Implementing Guidelines and Safeguards for VR Technology\",\n        \"Need\": \"Training on VR Content Creation, Curation, and Assessment\",\n        \"Support\": \"Adequate Training and Support for VR Integration\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"teachers\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Professional\",\n      \"description\": \"Teachers are professionals responsible for educating students, often in a classroom setting. They play a crucial role in the integration and effective use of new technologies, such as virtual reality, in educational practices.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Role\": \"Educational Professional\",\n        \"Responsibility\": \"Educating students and integrating new technologies into the classroom\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"student learning outcomes\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Outcome\",\n      \"description\": \"Student learning outcomes refer to the results or achievements that students are expected to gain from their educational experiences, including knowledge, skills, and attitudes.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Enhancement through VR\": \"VR technology can enhance student learning outcomes by promoting creativity and critical thinking, and fostering a deeper understanding of complex concepts and subjects.\",\n        \"Inclusivity and Accessibility\": \"Student learning outcomes can be improved by making education more inclusive and accessible to a diverse range of students through the use of VR technology.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Student Learning Outcomes\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Outcome\",\n      \"description\": \"The result of the educational process, reflecting the knowledge, skills, and attitudes that students acquire as a result of their learning experiences.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Creativity and Critical Thinking\",\n      \"type\": \"Cognitive Skills\",\n      \"description\": \"Creativity involves the ability to generate new ideas and solutions, while critical thinking is the ability to analyze information and concepts to form reasoned judgments.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Understanding of Complex Concepts\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Understanding\",\n      \"description\": \"A deeper and more comprehensive grasp of difficult or intricate ideas and theories.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Different Learning Styles\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Methodology\",\n      \"description\": \"Learning styles refer to the different ways individuals prefer to learn, such as visual, auditory, reading/writing, and kinesthetic.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Alternative Learning Experiences\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Experience\",\n      \"description\": \"Learning experiences that differ from traditional classroom settings, often designed to accommodate specific needs or preferences.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Educator Training\",\n 