 resources\",\n      \"type\": \"Resource Category\",\n      \"description\": \"A broad category of materials and tools used in education to facilitate learning and teaching.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"History Students\",\n      \"type\": \"Student Group\",\n      \"description\": \"History students are learners who study the past to understand the development of human societies and cultures.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Educational Resources\",\n      \"type\": \"Resource Type\",\n      \"description\": \"Educational resources are materials and tools used to facilitate learning and teaching. These can include textbooks, multimedia, and technological tools.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Inclusive Education\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Approach\",\n      \"description\": \"Inclusive education is an approach that ensures all students, regardless of their background or learning style, have equal access to educational opportunities.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Virtual Reality (VR) in Education\",\n      \"type\": \"Technology\",\n      \"description\": \"Virtual Reality is a technology that simulates environments and experiences, allowing users to interact with them in a seemingly real or physical way.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Surgical Procedures\",\n      \"type\": \"Medical Training\",\n      \"description\": \"Surgical procedures are medical operations performed by surgeons, which can be practiced in a virtual environment to enhance skills and reduce risks.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Historical Landmarks and Events\",\n      \"type\": \"Educational Content\",\n      \"description\": \"Historical landmarks and events are significant places and occurrences from the past that are often studied in educational settings.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n 